{"id":"0724d9f2bd401655","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-oracle.md","title":"Oracle","display":"df-oracle — Oracle","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-oracle","aliases":["58-df-oracle"],"display":"df-oracle — Oracle","depends_on":[]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-oracle"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-oracle</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-oracle — Oracle"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal O\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal O\\in V\\)</span> (set parameter)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Oracle}\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{Oracle}\\subseteq V\\)</span> (oracle predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle} \\vdash \\mathrm{Oracle}(\\mathcal O)\\leftrightarrow\\mathcal O\\subseteq\\omega\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle} \\vdash \\mathrm{Oracle}(\\mathcal O)\\leftrightarrow\\mathcal O\\subseteq\\omega\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>An oracle Turing machine, relative computation, relative enumerable sets, and Turing reducibility are downstream notions using an oracle <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal O\">\\(\\mathcal O\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal O\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Oracle}\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle} \\vdash \\mathrm{Oracle}(\\mathcal O)\\leftrightarrow\\mathcal O\\subseteq\\omega","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal O","display":false}],"bytes":589,"backlinks":[{"id":"84ea24a590d88f53","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e8d93d31f2068246","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Oracle}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch08/58-df-oracle.md]])"},{"id":"72859a2d81ce2e93","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\omega$ and $\\mathrm{Oracle}(A)$ (see [[58-df-oracle]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-911","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-oracle.md|58-df-oracle]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":[]}